#. module: pos_sale_planning
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_sale_planning/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"The invoice for this order will be generated in the related Sales Order, "
"because you used a payment method linked to a resource."
msgstr ""
"La factura de este pedido se generará en el pedido de venta correspondiente, "
"ya que has utilizado un método de pago vinculado a un recurso."

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_sale_planning.field_pos_payment_method__resource_ids
msgid ""
"The planning resources linked to this payment method. If there are several, "
"the user will be able to choose on the POS which one to use when validating "
"an order with this payment method."
msgstr ""
"Los recursos de Planificación vinculados a este método de pago. Si hay "
"varios, el usuario podrá elegir en el punto de venta cuál utilizar al "
"validar un pedido con este método de pago."

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pos_sale_planning.field_pos_payment_method__type
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Tipo"

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_sale_planning/static/src/app/models/pos_order.js:0
msgid ""
"You cannot add a resource linked payment method when the order contains "
"lines coming from a sale order. You can split the order if you want to pay "
"the other lines with this payment method."
msgstr ""
"No se puede añadir un método de pago vinculado a un recurso cuando el pedido "
"contiene líneas procedentes de un pedido de venta. Si deseas pagar las demás "
"líneas con este método de pago, puedes dividir el pedido."

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_sale_planning/static/src/app/screens/payment_screen/payment_screen.js:0
msgid ""
"You cannot add another payment method if there is already a resource-linked "
"payment on the order."
msgstr ""
"No se puede añadir otro método de pago si el pedido ya tiene un pago "
"vinculado a un recurso."

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_sale_planning/static/src/app/screens/payment_screen/payment_screen.js:0
msgid ""
"You cannot create an invoice for an order that will be paid with a resource-"
"linked payment method."
msgstr ""
"No se puede crear una factura para un pedido que se vaya a pagar con un "
"método de pago vinculado a un recurso."

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_sale_planning/static/src/app/screens/feedback_screen/feedback_screen.js:0
msgid ""
"You cannot edit the payment if there is a resource-linked payment method on "
"the order."
msgstr ""
"No se puede modificar el pago si el pedido tiene un método de pago vinculado "
"a un recurso."

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_sale_planning/static/src/app/screens/payment_screen/payment_screen.js:0
msgid ""
"You cannot pay with a resource-linked payment method if there are already "
"other payments."
msgstr ""
"No se puede pagar con un método de pago vinculado a un recurso si ya hay "
"otros pagos pendientes."

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_sale_planning/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot set the order to be invoiced because you used a payment method "
"linked to a resource. The invoice will be generated in the related Sales "
"Order."
msgstr ""
"No puedes marcar el pedido para facturarlo porque has utilizado un método de "
"pago vinculado a un recurso. La factura se generará en el pedido de venta "
"correspondiente."

#. module: pos_sale_planning
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_sale_planning/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot use more than one payment method when one of them is linked to a "
"resource"
msgstr ""
"No se puede utilizar más de un método de pago cuando uno de ellos está "
"vinculado a un recurso"

